    "body": "**P0 — This example configuration prevents both orchestrator profiles from resolving.** `gpt-4o` has no supported thinking levels in `ModelRegistryImpl`, while the example still sets `ORCHESTRATOR_FAST_THINKING_LEVEL=low` and `ORCHESTRATOR_ULTIMATE_THINKING_LEVEL=high` on lines 52–53. Copying `.env.example` therefore raises `ValidationError: thinking_level is unsupported by the frozen model route` for Fast and Ultimate. Please either remove those explicit thinking-level variables when selecting `gpt-4o`, or keep a reasoning-capable supervisor model; a profile-resolution test for this example combination would prevent recurrence.",
