    "body": "**P1 — The folded transcript still fails when context compaction is active.** `ContextCompiler._pair_safe_tail_indexes()` currently removes a call ID as soon as it encounters the first `ToolInteractionMessage` (`backend/execution/orchestrator/context.py:192`). The later interaction/final result for this same call is consequently selected as a standalone group, and `compile(..., summary=...)` raises `TranscriptCorruptionError: orphan tool result` (or `orphan tool interaction`) before provider submission. Please keep the originating assistant/tool group open across interaction messages and close it only on the final `ToolResultMessage`, with a summarized-compilation regression test using the multi-round fixture added here.",
