    "body": "**P1 — This permits a durable terminal winner to be reopened.** The failure-only state guard allows `completed -> input-required`, but this update does not fence on `terminal_projection_event_id`. The non-agent/supervisor HITL projection path calls this method from `execution/hitl/service.py:748-753`, so a late follow-up can produce an interactive row that still carries a terminal projection winner. Please make the reopen a CAS that also requires the terminal marker to be absent or null, and add a regression test with a completed row whose marker is non-null.",
