    "body": "**P1 — Different opaque IDs do not prove that this event is newer.** After round 2 completes, a delayed `input-required` event from round 1 has different request/interaction IDs and therefore bypasses the terminal-state guard, replacing the current prompt/resolution state with stale data. The same exception also reopens `failed`/`canceled` entities even though the backend treats those states as unresumable. Please require an authoritative monotonic generation/event sequence (or newer trusted timestamp) before reopening, restrict the exception to the backend-supported prior state, and add reverse-order plus failure-state tests.",
