    "body": "**P2 — This also removes rejected/failed surface-call diagnostics.** Schema errors, unknown presentation IDs, and publication failures produce a rejected `ToolResultMessage`, and the kernel explicitly returns `\"retry\"` so that diagnostic is available on the next model turn. Filtering solely by `tool_name` removes both sides of that pair (a rejected pair converts to `[]`), so the model cannot learn why the call failed and can repeat it until budget exhaustion. Please strip only successfully completed surface pairs and preserve failed/rejected assistant-result pairs; add transcript coverage for a rejected surface call.",
