    "body": "**P2 — A null marker is treated as a terminal winner here.** This query accepts only `$exists: false`, but the repository's other terminal-winner CAS paths intentionally treat a missing marker and `terminal_projection_event_id: null` as equivalent (`message_store.py:229-234,343-346`). A reusable completed row carrying the legacy/null representation therefore cannot open its next valid HITL round, and projection aborts before emitting the request. Please use an `$or` for missing or null while continuing to reject non-null winners, and add a null-marker test beside the existing winner case.",
    "created_at": "2026-08-31T00:42:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-31T00:42:32Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/hybroai/hybro/pull/169#discussion_r3891022030",
